title Your partner goes to the ball
intro Red has the ball near your half.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-CM at 44, 24
  player R-RF at 55, 16
  player B-LB at 30, 20
  player B-CB at 26, 40
  ball with R-CM

step
  caption You are the defender in blue. Watch what happens.
  label B-CB You

step
  caption Your teammate runs out to close Red down. Another Red player sprints into the space behind.
  B-LB to 41, 23
  R-RF to 34, 14
  arrow from B-LB to R-CM
  arrow from R-RF to 26, 18
  duration 1100

step
  caption Drop in behind your partner — you are the backup.
  B-CB to 32, 28
  arrow from 26, 40 to B-CB
  arrow from R-RF to 28, 20
  duration 1100

question
  prompt Your partner runs out to the ball and Red sends a runner behind them. What do you do?
  answer Drop in behind them to cover
  wrong Run at the ball as well
  wrong Stay exactly where you are
  wrong Push up to the halfway line
  correct Cover the space behind.
  why One defender goes to the ball, the other backs them up. If your partner gets beaten, you are the next wall.

question
  prompt What if you both chase the ball?
  answer Red can pass into the gap
  wrong You win it twice as fast
  wrong You both get to the ball first
  wrong Red has to kick it out
  correct Red can pass into the gap.
  why Two players on one ball leaves a hole behind you. Take turns: one presses, one covers.
